{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PrepWell Pro 是一款為經常下廚人士而設的智能食譜與餐單管理工具，能把散落於網站、食譜卡與社交平台的內容整理成個人廚房資料庫，並自動編排每週餐單與購物清單。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合想減少備餐混亂、提升下廚效率的家庭煮夫煮婦與備餐愛好者。</p>\n\n<h2>由食譜到購物清單一手掌握</h2>\n<p>輕點一下即可從任何網站匯入食譜，智能匯入會自動整理食材、步驟與份量，亦可拍攝食譜卡交由 AI 擷取。烹調模式具備螢幕長亮、步驟計時與即時份量換算，在爐前也能輕鬆跟隨。餐單規劃支援拖放編排每週菜式，並自動生成按貨架分區的購物清單。廚房庫存設有到期提示與條碼掃描，雲端同步讓各裝置隨時接續。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-144-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-145-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-146-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-147-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-148-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-149-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PrepWell Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T23:19:37.314624+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":340,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T22:58:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T02:18:02.396709+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T23:17:39.164185+00:00","content_hash":"647b70d1a1def906624e17fcc4fd5a922fee6473418c2dfdf9beca8abb20c92e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}